// Continental, 4 AIs from the Middle Ages, a population limit the AIs reach (base ini unit_limit=750: a cap of about
// 220 each) and resources piled up as in a long game: 20000 of each for every AI at minutes 1, 15 and 30. The citizen
// shelf (shelve_citizens) and army_plan KIND (64): what does an AI make of the bank at its cap?

wait_until(1min)
give(2, 20000, resource.all)
give(3, 20000, resource.all)
give(4, 20000, resource.all)
give(5, 20000, resource.all)
wait_until(15min)
give(2, 20000, resource.all)
give(3, 20000, resource.all)
give(4, 20000, resource.all)
give(5, 20000, resource.all)
wait_until(30min)
give(2, 20000, resource.all)
give(3, 20000, resource.all)
give(4, 20000, resource.all)
give(5, 20000, resource.all)
